  "editorial": {
    "name": "Acedomains/ui",
    "descriptionZh": "ENS 应用共用的一套函数与组件库，README 列的是 setupENS、getOwner、setResolver 这类域名读写接口，外加子域名、反向记录、文本记录的处理。仓库三年没动，最后一次提交是在给空投合约补函数。",
    "takeawayZh": "一份 ENS 域名读写函数清单，先看 setupENS",
    "noteZh": "README 的标题是 Reusable functions and components for the ENS apps，正文第一句说 Most functions in this library are async functions and therefore return promises which can be awaited or chained with .then.，然后按 Registry and Resolvers 列出 setupENS()、getOwner()、getResolver()、getTTL()、getAddress()、getName()、getSubdomains()、setSubnodeOwner()、createSubdomain()、setText()、claimAndSetReverseRecord() 等接口，Setup 一段演示从 @ensdomains/ui 导入。仓库右侧 About 挂 BSD-2-Clause license，Languages 条写 JavaScript 100%，Contributors 只有 blascokoa 一人，最后一次提交是 feat: add more functions for the airdrop contract，停在 3 年前。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
